# Development only. Copy to .env (git-ignored) and paste your Presage API key.
# Get a key at https://physiology.presagetech.com/auth/login
# The app itself stores the key with the OS keychain (Electron safeStorage);
# this file is read only by the Stage 1 probe and, if present, offered once
# to the app's Setup screen in development builds.
SMARTSPECTRA_API_KEY=
